  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/5FKz/17",
  "contentHtml": "<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">강연이 끝나고 저희 학교 선생님들끼리 이야기를 좀 나누었습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">신혜쌤과는 서로의 일행이 있어 반갑게 악수하고 헤어질 수밖에 없었습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">(</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">졸업한 이후 아주 오랜만에 만났는데 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">1</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">분 인사하고 헤어져 아쉬웠습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">. ^^)</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">학교쌤들끼리 나눈 얘기의 가장 큰 쟁점은 </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">모두 협동학습으로 수업을 하고 있는 선생님들이었기에</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">내가 하고 있는 수업에서 그 차시의 핵심내용을 영상으로 제작해 빼버리고 활동수업을 좀 더 늘리면 </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">그것이 거꾸로 수업인가 하는 부분이었습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">그렇다와 아니다 사이에 많은 얘기들이 있었습니다만 조금 더 많은 공감은 그렇지 않을까 쪽이었습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">그러면서 거꾸로 교실에서 나타난 효과들이 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">거꾸로교실이 가져온 효과라기보다 </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">일반강의식 수업 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">VS </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">협동학습의 효과를 비교한 것이 아닌가 하는 얘기도 하였습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">두 분의 국어선생님께서는 </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">일주일 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">4</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">차시의 수업을 모두 모둠으로 활동수업을 하고 계시고</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">, </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">저는 한번은 강의식</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">한번은 모둠별 수업으로 진행하고 있습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">때로는 수업의 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">25</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">분정도는 영상과 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">PPT</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">를 이용한 강의식</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">그리고 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">15</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">분정도 모둠활동을 하기도 하구요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">두 분의 국어선생님은 올해 학교로 전임해오신지라 </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">모둠수업의 내용이 어떤 식으로 흘러가는지는 잘 모르겠습니다만 </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">제 경우는 협동학습의 몇몇 구조</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">(</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">암기숙달구조</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">정보교환구조 등</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">)</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">를 활용해 </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">아이들이 활동할 수 있는 부분을 조금 주었다는 것이지 수업의 주도권은 여전히 저에게 있습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">학생들은 제가 준 시간동안 주어진 활동을 해내야 하는거지요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">그 또한 가장 효율성</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">(?)</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">이 높은 방법들로만 선택해 모둠활동을 시킵니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">예를 들자면</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">눈의 구조를 영상과 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">PPT</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">를 이용해 제가 수업한 다음에</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">, </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">플래시카드로 모둠별로 서로 돌아가며 명칭을 공부하고</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">, </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">모둠별 칠판나누기나 서바이벌 게임식으로 공부한 내용을 확인한 뒤</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">, </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">학습지 정리와 함께 마무리 하는 거지요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">수업시간의 여유가 된다면</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">아예 한 차시를 눈의 구조와 기능을 이론수업으로 한 뒤에</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">,</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">모둠별로 눈의 각 부분 특징을 살릴 수 있는 생활소품들을 정하고 준비물과 역할을 나누는 작업을 한 다음</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">, </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">다음 차시에 모둠별 눈모형 만들기 및 발표를 하기도 했습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">맥락막에 검은 비닐봉다리</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">각막에 랩</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">홍채로 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">CD</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">를 들고 와 한 모둠도 있었던 것 같습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">만약 예를 든 수업을 거꾸로 수업방식으로 만든다면 어찌하면 될까요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">?</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">눈의 구조와 기능에 대한 핵심내용을 영상으로 만들고</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">아이들이 진지하게 다 보고 왔다고 가정한다면 </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">플래시카드를 이용한 용어공부와 소눈 해부나 다른 활동들을 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">45</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">분안에 한번에 할 수 있지 않을까</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">?</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">&nbsp;</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">그렇게 하는 것이 거꾸로 수업인지는 모르겠지만</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">, </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">일단 진도의 압박에서 짧게 하거나 할 수 없었던 모둠활동을 할 시간은 좀 더 확보가 될 수도 있겠다는게 일차적으로 얻은 느낌입니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">그 다음은 동영상에 담길 내용에 대한 부분이었습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">어떻게 만드느냐는 방법적인 부분은 해보지 않았지만 크게 걱정되지 않는 부분인건 공통적이었는데</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">동영상의 내용을 어디까지 할 것인가였습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">영상에 모든 내용을 담을 것인가</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">(</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">모든 내용을 담을 수 있나</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">??)</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">와 일부분의 내용을 담을 것인가 하는 부분에 대한 내용이었습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">실제 거꾸로 교실에 참여하셨던 선생님 중 한분도 </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">학생들이 동영상을 보고 오게 하는 것도 힘든 점 중에 하나였다 하셨고</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">, </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">다양한 방법</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">(</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">클래스팅</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">모둠점수 등등</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">)</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">으로 계속 관리했다고 하셨습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">&nbsp;</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">만약 수업 시작 때 대다수의 아이들이 동영상시청을 하지 않고 왔을 때 어찌할 것인가의 부분을 고민하다 보니 영상을 보지 않고도 활동수업이 가능하다면 영상을 만들고 보고 오게 하는 것이 의미가 없지 않는가 하는 점과 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">5</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">분내외의 짧은 영상안에 핵심내용이 모두 담긴다면 그저 암기할 것을 찝어주는 것이 되고 그렇게 보고 온 것을 가지고 학생들의 머릿속에 있다하고 그 내용을 응용하는 활동수업을 할 수 있겠는가였습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">&nbsp;</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">여기서 과목의 특성이 조금 갈렸는데요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">저나 다른 과학쌤은 학생들이 안보면 어찌하나는 일단 접어두고 한차시의 핵심내용을 담은 영상을 만들면</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">아이들이 몇 번이고 반복해서 볼 수 있고</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">그 내용을 다양한 방법의 모둠활동으로 적용해 이해할 수 있는 활동을 수업시간에 구성해보면 안될까하는 긍정적인 반응이었다면 국어 선생님들은 부정적인 반응이 많았습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">제가 국어의 내용은 잘 몰라 그 선생님들의 설명을 고대로 전할 수 없어 죄송하네요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">^^; </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">암튼 대충의 의미는 시나 문학을 배우는데 핵심내용을 미리 정리해 전달하는 것에 대해 회의적이었고</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">아마 수업전체를 모둠수업으로 하고 계시면서 마무리 정리때만 강의식으로 하시고 계시기에 굳이 지금 선생님 수업자체에서 동영상을 더 제작하는 것이 의미가 없다는 뜻이기도 하셨습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">. (</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">국어과라도 그쌤 수업 한번 참관하고 싶더라구요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">쫌 친해져봐야겠어요 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 좋은_동심\">ㅎㅎ</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">)</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">핵심내용을 모두 담느냐 일부분만 담느냐는 저와 다른 과학쌤사이에도 의견이 좀 갈렸지만</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">헤어질 시간이 다가와 마무리는 못했습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">더불어 그 과학쌤과는 현재 동학년인데 저희학교는 책을 반으로 나누어 그쌤과 제가 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">2</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">차시씩 같이 전반을 들어가는 구조라서</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">~~ </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">협업이 안되는 점을 매우 안타까워하며 수다는 끝났습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">동행하신 국어선생님 중 한 분은 직접 한번 해보시겠다고 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 좋은_동심\">「</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">거꾸로교실</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">.kr</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 좋은_동심\">」</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">에서 신청하셨고</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">나머지선생님들은 일단 보류입니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">저는 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">1</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">학기말부터 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">5</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">단원 전기를 들어가게 될거 같아서</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">지금부터 준비해서 그 한단원만 일단 해볼까 하고 있습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">. 3</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">학년을 올해 가르치는데 이 아이들이 기술시간 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">3</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">월에 전기를 배우더라구요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">물론 기술과목에서는 전류</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">전압</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">저항의 개념과 옴의법칙</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">그리고 저항의 직렬</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">/</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">병렬연결</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">전기회로</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">전력과 전력량 등 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">2-3</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">차시 정도 배우고 전기전자부품이나 수리 등으로 넘어가지만요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">. 1</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">학기때 다른 과목에서 일단 한번 배웠던 것이니 영상으로 기본내용을 공부해오고 학교에서 보충 또는 심화활동을 모둠으로 해보게끔 할까 합니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">일단 해보는 과정에서 배우지않을까 생각하고 있습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">&nbsp;PD</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">님은 절대적으로 팀플레이를 강조하셨는데</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">혼자서 엉뚱한 쪽으로 삽질하는 건 아닐까 걱정도 됩니다만 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 좋은_동심\">ㅎㅎ </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">2</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">차 프로젝트에 신청하자니 너무 일을 크게 벌리나 싶기도 하고</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">동학년의 의견이 같은 과학교사를 당장 찾기는 힘들어서 이곳에서 조금씩 쌤들의 의견을 듣는 것으로 일단 한단원만 해보는거죠 뭐</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">~~</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">강의내용 중에 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">21</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">세기 인재가 갖춰야 할 자질이라며 나왔던 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">ppt</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">의 한 장면이 있었습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">요즘 들어 한번씩 봤었던 내용이지만 이날은 이런 저런 생각이 많았습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/276DCA44535F451E2A\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"299\" height=\"294\" style=\"WIDTH: 299px; FLOAT: none; HEIGHT: 294px; CLEAR: none\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"576\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\"  id=\"A_276DCA44535F451E2A5FB6\"/><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2141EE44535F451F33\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"263\" height=\"296\" style=\"WIDTH: 263px; FLOAT: none; HEIGHT: 296px; CLEAR: none\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"576\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\"  id=\"A_2141EE44535F451F33484A\"/></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">나는 아이들의 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">4C(Critical thinking, Creativity, Communication, Collaboration)</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">를 키워줄 수 있는 </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">수업을 하고 있을까</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">? </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">그럴 기회는 주고 있을까</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">? </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">가르친다는 말속에 숨어 있는 지식 전달에만 급급해 하고 있지는 않을까</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">?</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">애들은 둘째치고 저에게 숨어있을 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">4C</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">의 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">1%</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">라도 쫌 끄집어 내지면 좋을텐데요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\">.</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 좋은_동심\">ㅎㅎㅎ</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 좋은_동심\">암튼 다녀온 후기는 여기까지 입니다.</SPAN></P>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
